INDAI</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>ATSUMI KANAME</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>YAMAKAWA JINDAI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>ATSUMI, KANAME</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>YAMAKAWA, JINDAI</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A rotation stopper for opening and closing plate, comprising opening and closing plates (3) which are installed rotatably at both ends of a base part (1) and formed so that they can be opened and closed laterally from the state of being closed, the opening and closing plate being held at closed positions by holding means (5 and 6), respectively, and stopping means (15 and 16) which stop the opening and closing plates midway during the opening operation, respectively.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention concerne un dispositif d'arrêt de pivotement pour plaque d'ouverture et de fermeture, qui comporte des plaques (3) d'ouverture et de fermeture installées pivotantes aux deux extrémités d'une partie (1) de base, et formées de telle sorte qu'elles peuvent être ouvertes et fermées latéralement à partir de l'état fermé. Les plaques d'ouverture et de fermeture sont maintenues en position fermée par un moyen (5 et 6) de retenue, respectivement, et par un moyen (15, 16) d'arrêt qui arrête les plaques d'ouverture et de fermeture à mi-chemin au cours de l'opération d'ouverture, respectivement.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, ti